Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(shell):=20=E5=9B=9E=E9=80=80=20detached=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=94=B9=E5=8A=A8=EF=BC=8C=E4=BF=9D=E6=8C=81=20process?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=2Eplatform=20!=3D=3D=20=22win32=22?=
